### Description of change

Added generics types (default to "typeof Model) to all associations class definitions:

- HasOne
- HasMany
- BelongsTo
- BelongsToMany

These associations can now be defined as follow

```typescript
// ...
public static associations: {
  group: BelongsTo<User, UserGroup>;
};
// ...

/**
 * userType is now a "typeof User" instead of "typeof Model" 
 */
const userType: typeof User = User.associations.group.source;
```
Also, associations methods now returns the typed associations

```typescript
/**
 * Group is now a "BelongsTo<User, UserGroup>" instead of "BelongsTo" 
 */
export const Group = User.belongsTo(UserGroup, { as: 'group', foreignKey: 'groupId' });
```

